            "sid": "ISA 56:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae, Wugwok pokolembe, man wutim bedopwe; kum both para ni ceng’ni bino, man judhingo nyutho bedopwe para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugisa ni ng’atu m’utimo maeni, man ni wod dhanu m’umoko i kume; m’ugwoko ceng’ sabatu kum eide, man m’ucero cinge ku timo gin moko ma rac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi kud wuyi jawirok, m’uribre gire ba Yehova, uyer, uwac kumae, Yehova bikoya ku dhanu pare andha; kadi kud wuyi jamugumba wac kumae, Nen, an a yen m’uthwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova yero pi jumugumba m’ugwoko ceng’ sabatu para, man m’ufoyo gin ma nyayu mutoro i ia, man m’umoko kum lembariba para kumae: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimio igi nying’ mi poi i ot para man yor i gang’kidi para ma sagu nyithindho ma co ku nyithindho ma nyir; abimio igi nying’ mi nja, ma bikabre woko ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man juwirok bende m’uribre gigi ba Yehova, kara gitim ire, man kara gimar nying’ Yehova, kara gibed jutic pare, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu m’ukwiro ceng’ sabatu kum eide, man m’umoko kum lembariba para; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 21:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 11:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 19:46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gin nini abiterogi ba got ma leng’ para, man abinyayu mutoro i igi i ot mi rwo para: lam m’awang’a migi ku lam migi biyire wi pemblam para; kum jubilwong’o ot para ot mi rwo ni kodhidhanu ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Yehova, m’ucoko ju ma jubayu mir Israel, uwacu kumae, Fodi abicoko jumange i bang’e, medo jupare ma dhe ma jucoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu yedi ceke m’i thim, wubin kara wucam, eyo, wu yedi ceke m’i luli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jukur pare gin abinga, kagi ceke ng’eyong’ec umbe kugi; kagi ceke gi gwok m’ajuba, gicopo gbuyo ngo; ma gibeleko lek, givuto piny, gimaru nuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, gwok gi jungiri, gicopo bedo ku ma romo gi ngo; man maeni gi jukwac ma copo ng’eyo ngo: kagi ceke gilokri ng’atuman i yo pare ma dhe, kubang’gi kubang’gi ng’atuman ba kuloka pare, ku ba thepiny ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubin, giwacu, abikelo pigulok, man wabiyengra giwa ku giramadha ma lake tek; e urwo bibedo calu ceng’ maeni, ceng’ ma dit ma sagu mukero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
